    "body": "This is confusing. Setting _descendant_ and then continuing does nothing, since then you will enter the top of the for loop, which resets _descendant_ to the next value in the list of descendants of _focus target_.\r\n\r\nAlso, I have no idea what you would be doing with the last descendant of _descendant_.\r\n\r\nIf you were trying to just skip these elements, I think the correct thing would be \"then continue\"?",
