    "body": "Sorry for the delay.\r\n\r\nI'm still confused by these examples.\r\n\r\n- Why does `childpopover` have an `autofocus` attribute, if you don't want to autofocus it?\r\n\r\n- Why are you showing the child before the parent? Does that even work? I thought the parent would still be `display: none` so you wouldn't see the child.",
